2958
01:51:34.820 --> 01:51:36.370
Like, what is it?

2959
01:51:36.370 --> 01:51:38.260
Which part of their ego is holding them back?

2960
01:51:38.260 --> 01:51:40.270
And what is it that they value most

2961
01:51:40.270 --> 01:51:42.630
that their ego is driving, you know,

2962
01:51:42.630 --> 01:51:44.810
is like taking that train has left the station

2963
01:51:44.810 --> 01:51:47.310
and you can't pull them back from that, right?

2964
01:51:47.310 --> 01:51:52.310
So identifying that is key because you can't really be free,

2965
01:51:53.300 --> 01:51:55.800
if there's ego behind anything.

2966
01:51:55.800 --> 01:51:56.633
You really have to...

2967
01:51:56.633 --> 01:51:57.560
I think it's a constant battle.

2968
01:51:57.560 --> 01:52:00.870
For me it's a daily battle of looking at something.

2969
01:52:00.870 --> 01:52:02.489
If I'm saying something to someone,

2970
01:52:02.489 --> 01:52:04.110
if there's advice I wanna give,

2971
01:52:04.110 --> 01:52:06.188
it's like what is this rooted in Maggie?

2972
01:52:06.188 --> 01:52:07.021
Right.

2973
01:52:07.021 --> 01:52:08.610
Is it rooted in like you having more knowledge?

2974
01:52:08.610 --> 01:52:10.160
Is it rooted in you being right?

2975
01:52:10.160 --> 01:52:12.040
Is it rooted in how someone's going to perceive you?

2976
01:52:12.040 --> 01:52:13.180
Like, what is that?

2977
01:52:13.180 --> 01:52:14.740
Or is it completely genuine?

2978
01:52:14.740 --> 01:52:16.050
And if it is great.

2979
01:52:16.050 --> 01:52:19.430
Is that process, do you think that process is easier

2980
01:52:19.430 --> 01:52:22.790
