2981
01:52:22.790 --> 01:52:25.770
Like when you're a celebrity, or you're on billboards

2982
01:52:25.770 --> 01:52:26.797
and all that kind of stuff,

2983
01:52:26.797 --> 01:52:31.360
obviously it's very easy for your ego to get outsized.

2984
01:52:31.360 --> 01:52:33.250
But that also brings it up,

2985
01:52:33.250 --> 01:52:35.970
like it makes it very present, like oh my God,

2986
01:52:35.970 --> 01:52:39.170
like my ego, my attachment to this identity

2987
01:52:39.170 --> 01:52:42.870
and how other people see me and my future,

2988
01:52:42.870 --> 01:52:46.160
you know career trajectory and Hollywood like,

2989
01:52:46.160 --> 01:52:47.280
that makes...

2990
01:52:47.280 --> 01:52:49.050
Like you're in the business of ego.

2991
01:52:49.050 --> 01:52:51.127
So you're forced to confront it in a certain way

2992
01:52:51.127 --> 01:52:54.210
and in a manner that like a normal civilian wouldn't.

2993
01:52:54.210 --> 01:52:55.043
Right.

2994
01:52:55.043 --> 01:52:56.970
So, to me it feels

2995
01:52:56.970 --> 01:53:01.870
like it can go like, because it's so present in your life

2996
01:53:01.870 --> 01:53:04.000
it can either really go horribly wrong,

2997
01:53:04.000 --> 01:53:06.360
or it compels you to face it and work through it

2998
01:53:06.360 --> 01:53:10.310
so that you can have a healthier approach to life.

2999
01:53:10.310 --> 01:53:13.240
I think luckily, you know

3000
01:53:13.240 --> 01:53:15.677
as far as the Hollywood thing goes,

3001
01:53:15.677 --> 01:53:19.850
I think my saving grace in Hollywood,

3002
01:53:19.850 --> 01:53:23.590
like has been like that worthlessness,

3003
01:53:23.590 --> 01:53:25.480
that feeling of like that void.

3004
01:53:25.480 --> 01:53:27.280
That thing that I can't fill.

3005
01:53:27.280 --> 01:53:28.200
So-

3006
01:53:28.200 --> 01:53:29.159
Right,

3007
01:53:29.159 --> 01:53:32.240
cause if I'm like, you know in the Tiber with Tom cruise

3008
01:53:32.240 --> 01:53:33.970
and I still feel like we're more (murmurs),

3009
01:53:33.970 --> 01:53:35.840
you know, like then really

3010
01:53:35.840 --> 01:53:38.214
there's something that I need to look at that.

3011
01:53:38.214 --> 01:53:39.791
Because it doesn't make any sense.

3012
01:53:39.791 --> 01:53:41.220
Right, and so that's a struggle.

3013
01:53:41.220 --> 01:53:45.650
And then I think in the personal that's where my ego

3014
01:53:45.650 --> 01:53:47.520
