3018
01:53:58.280 --> 01:54:00.800
for most people it's more important to be right,

3019
01:54:00.800 --> 01:54:03.090
than it is to have peace.

3020
01:54:03.090 --> 01:54:04.140
Yeah.
Right.

3021
01:54:04.140 --> 01:54:07.900
And I don't think that's worth it, right?

3022
01:54:07.900 --> 01:54:08.810
And there was a time

3023
01:54:08.810 --> 01:54:13.810
where it was just such, you know as somewhat volatile person

3024
01:54:14.150 --> 01:54:17.250
where that really was where I was at,

3025
01:54:17.250 --> 01:54:20.350
it was like, I think for most of my life I felt wrong.

3026
01:54:20.350 --> 01:54:22.050
I felt like I didn't belong.

3027
01:54:22.050 --> 01:54:23.870
I didn't deserve, I didn't all these things.

3028
01:54:23.870 --> 01:54:27.040
So wherever I had the power to have that, I wanted it.

3029
01:54:27.040 --> 01:54:29.210
You know, whether I was going to be in relationship,

3030
01:54:29.210 --> 01:54:30.590
or friendship, whatever, it was.

3031
01:54:30.590 --> 01:54:34.240
Like I was gonna take my power back in that specific area.

3032
01:54:34.240 --> 01:54:36.846
And that's all ego, right?

3033
01:54:36.846 --> 01:54:41.846
